docs {
  # 08. Partially Update Expense (Creator or Owner)

  **Method:** `PATCH`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/groups/:groupID/expenses/:expenseID`
  **Auth:** Required (Bearer token)

  ## Description

  Changes only the fields present in the JSON body. Active original creator or current group owner only; inactive groups are frozen. Former members have no access, including a former creator. Payer, creator, group and expense_type are immutable. All expense/share/receipt changes are atomic. Concurrent saves serialize; the last applied values win. This endpoint has no optimistic version check.

  ## Request

  | Field | Type | Behavior |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | title | string | Trimmed, non-empty, maximum 200 Unicode characters. |
  | description | string or null | Replace; null clears. |
  | total_amount_toman | positive integer | Integer TOMAN. Recalculates existing EQUAL/PERCENTAGE/WEIGHTED shares; EXACT values must sum to the new amount. |
  | split_type | string enum | EQUAL, EXACT, PERCENTAGE, WEIGHTED; uppercase and case-sensitive. Changing the method requires shares in the same request. |
  | occurred_at | RFC3339 timestamp | Replace expense date. |
  | shares | array | Replaces the ENTIRE set, not a delta. Unique group member IDs; current or former members accepted. Non-empty. |
  | attachment_ids | integer array | Complete desired receipt set; [] unlinks all. New receipts must be the editor own unclaimed EXPENSE_RECEIPT uploads, in this group or unscoped. Existing expense receipts may be retained regardless of uploader. |

  Omitted fields remain unchanged. Only description accepts null. An empty body or a body with no recognized editable fields returns 400 BAD_REQUEST. Unknown fields cannot change payer/creator; otherwise the project JSON binder ignores them. shares[].value follows Create Expense: EQUAL absent/null/1, EXACT non-negative integer amounts summing to total, PERCENTAGE numbers with at most two decimal places summing to 100, WEIGHTED positive integers. Number strings and exponent notation for share values are invalid.

  ### Update text only

  ```json
  {
    "description": "Updated receipt details"
  }
  ```

  ### Add or replace receipts

  Upload first with 07. Upload Expense Receipt. This list must contain every receipt to keep; omitting an existing ID detaches it without physically deleting the file.

  ```json
  {
    "attachment_ids": [
      1201
    ]
  }
  ```

  ### Clear description and remove all receipts

  ```json
  {
    "description": null,
    "attachment_ids": []
  }
  ```

  ### Change financial allocation

  ```json
  {
    "total_amount_toman": 100,
    "split_type": "PERCENTAGE",
    "shares": [
      {
        "member_id": 30,
        "value": 50
      },
      {
        "member_id": 31,
        "value": 25
      },
      {
        "member_id": 32,
        "value": 25
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

  ## Response

  **200 OK**. Same structure as Get Expense. This example assumes receipt 1201 was already attached before the description-only PATCH. Existing shares and files stay intact; updated_at is the expense update time. Access URLs expire (15 minutes by default); refetch when needed.

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 1101,
      "group_id": 10,
      "created_by_member_id": 30,
      "paid_by_member_id": 30,
      "title": "Dinner",
      "description": "Updated receipt details",
      "total_amount_toman": 100,
      "expense_type": "NORMAL",
      "split_type": "EQUAL",
      "occurred_at": "2026-11-16T10:00:00Z",
      "created_at": "2026-11-16T10:01:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-16T11:00:00Z",
      "is_frozen": false,
      "can_edit": true,
      "can_delete": true,
      "shares": [
        {
          "member_id": 30,
          "value": 1,
          "share_amount_toman": 34
        },
        {
          "member_id": 31,
          "value": 1,
          "share_amount_toman": 33
        },
        {
          "member_id": 32,
          "value": 1,
          "share_amount_toman": 33
        }
      ],
      "my_share_amount_toman": 34,
      "attachment_ids": [
        1201
      ],
      "attachments": [
        {
          "id": 1201,
          "original_filename": "receipt.png",
          "mime_type": "image/png",
          "file_size_bytes": 68,
          "access_url": "https://storage.example.com/doratou-storage/attachments/expense_receipt/3/2026/11/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001_receipt.png?X-Amz-Signature=example"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  | HTTP | code | error | When |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | 400 | `BAD_REQUEST` | `bad request payload or parameters` | Invalid path ID, pagination, JSON field, positive total amount, required field, title, or timestamp. |
  | 400 | `EXPENSE_INVALID_SPLIT` | `provide valid split values for the selected split type` | Unknown split type, invalid value, missing non-EQUAL value, percentage precision above two decimal places, or non-positive weight. |
  | 400 | `EXPENSE_SPLIT_TOTAL_MISMATCH` | `exact shares must sum to total_amount_toman and percentages must sum to 100` | EXACT values do not sum to the expense total or PERCENTAGE values do not sum to exactly 100. |
  | 400 | `EXPENSE_DUPLICATE_MEMBERS` | `shares must not contain duplicate member IDs` | A member_id appears more than once. |
  | 400 | `EXPENSE_DUPLICATE_ATTACHMENTS` | `attachment_ids must not contain duplicate IDs` | Repeated receipt IDs. |
  | 400 | `INVALID_FILE_TYPE` | `file type or format is not supported` | An attachment is not an EXPENSE_RECEIPT. |
  | 403 | `ATTACHMENT_FORBIDDEN` | `you do not have permission to access or modify this attachment` | Receipt belongs to another expense/group, or an unbound receipt was uploaded by another user. |
  | 404 | `ATTACHMENT_NOT_FOUND` | `attachment not found` | Receipt ID does not exist or was deleted. |
  | 401 | `MISSING_TOKEN` | `authorization token is missing` | Authorization is absent or does not contain a Bearer token. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_INVALID` | `authorization token is invalid` | Access token is invalid or malformed. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_EXPIRED` | `authorization token has expired` | Access token expired. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_REVOKED` | `authorization token has been revoked` | Access token is blacklisted. |
  | 403 | `USER_INACTIVE` | `user account is deactivated` | Authenticated account is not ACTIVE. |
  | 403 | `EXPENSE_FORBIDDEN` | `only active group members can access expenses` | Requester is not an ACTIVE member, or left_at is not null. This also applies to a former expense creator. |
  | 403 | `EXPENSE_EDITOR_REQUIRED` | `only the expense creator or current group owner can edit or delete this expense` | An active requester is neither this expense creator nor current group owner. |
  | 404 | `USER_NOT_FOUND` | `user not found` | Authenticated account no longer exists. |
  | 404 | `GROUP_NOT_FOUND` | `group not found` | Group does not exist or is soft-deleted. |
  | 404 | `EXPENSE_NOT_FOUND` | `expense not found` | Expense does not exist, is soft-deleted, or belongs to another group. |
  | 404 | `EXPENSE_PARTICIPANT_NOT_FOUND` | `a selected participant does not belong to this group's current or former members` | An ID is unknown or belongs to another group. |
  | 409 | `EXPENSE_GROUP_INACTIVE` | `expenses cannot be changed while the group is inactive` | Group is INACTIVE; expense creation, updates and deletion are frozen. |
  | 500 | `INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR` | `an internal server error occurred` | Database or authentication infrastructure failed; causes remain private. |
  | 503 | `STORAGE_UNAVAILABLE` | `storage service is temporarily unavailable` | Receipt or avatar URL generation failed. |
}
